This repo is ABS Zalo Bot. Read AGENTS.md, BRAND.md and docs/agent-handoff.md before changing anything.

Hard boundaries:
- Every outbound message is a side effect: draft_first and an empty allowlist stay fail-closed.
- Never delegate safety decisions to an LLM. Policy, routing, audit and redaction live in code.
- Do not add broadcast, spam, friend-list mutation, group administration, login bypass, OTP/PIN handling.
- Keep the official Zalo OA adapter separate from the unofficial personal-QR adapter.
- Never hardcode server paths, endpoints or tokens. Everything goes through environment variables.

Run before proposing a commit: npm test && npm run validate-config && npm run secret-scan

Tieng Viet: moi tin gui di deu phai co nguoi duyet. Quyet dinh an toan nam trong code,
khong nam trong prompt. Zalo OA va Zalo ca nhan la hai duong tach biet.
